1
00:00:06,673 --> 00:00:08,048
This isn't right.

2
00:00:08,048 --> 00:00:08,925
What isn't?

3
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:10,096
You said I'm getting

4
00:00:10,097 --> 00:00:11,350
the scholarship.

5
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:14,264
True.

6
00:00:14,264 --> 00:00:15,807
But now you're telling me

7
00:00:15,807 --> 00:00:17,934
to play a duet with him?

8
00:00:17,934 --> 00:00:18,518
Are you scared?

9
00:00:19,102 --> 00:00:20,020
What?

10
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:22,814
Are you afraid you'll lose

11
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:24,149
the scholarship to Seonghun?

12
00:00:24,149 --> 00:00:26,484
Don't be ridiculous.

13
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:27,861
To that clueless-looking guy?

14
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:28,727
Then there's nothing

15
00:00:28,728 --> 00:00:29,695
to worry about.

16
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:31,614
If he's as clueless as you say

17
00:00:31,614 --> 00:00:32,702
the scholarship is

18
00:00:32,703 --> 00:00:33,824
as good as yours.

19
00:00:33,825 --> 00:00:35,160
That's not the point.

20
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,077
Enough.

21
00:00:36,619 --> 00:00:37,912
Stop acting like a child.

22
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:46,283
Dong-uk, you're better than

23
00:00:46,284 --> 00:00:47,880
anyone else.

24
00:00:47,881 --> 00:00:49,924
You haven't even started yet.

25
00:00:49,924 --> 00:00:50,925
Don't be so nervous.

26
00:01:05,397 --> 00:01:07,025
Who said I was nervous?
